<title>HONG KONG: Trading in Hopewell /CEPA shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Hopewell /CEPA shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Hopewell Holdings Ltd and its unit Consolidated Electric Power Asia Ltd (CEPA) was suspended on Tuesday at the request of the companies pending announcements, the Hong Kong stock exchange said.</p>
<p>Hopewell shares closed at HK$4.425 on Monday and CEPA at HK$16.10.  </p>
<p>Trading in Hopewell and CEPA warrants was also suspended.</p>
<p>Hopewell said last month it was considering selling all or part of its stake in CEPA. It has a 60.4 percent stake.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6345</p>
</text>
